msgid "语言、区域与资源"
msgstr "Languages, locales, and resources"

msgid "文本"
msgstr "Text"

msgid ""
"图形应用使用 UTF-8，中文和日语显示依赖随系统 staging 的 CJK 字体， 输入法由会话提供。 剪贴板、路径、文档格式和 GPT 名称分别处理编码，不能逐字节截断 Unicode。 "
"不要把可显示中文等同于完整 Unicode 分词、双向排版或 grapheme-break 支持。"
msgstr ""
"Graphical applications use UTF-8. Chinese and Japanese display depends on CJK fonts staged with "
"the system; input methods are supplied by the session. Clipboards, paths, document formats, and "
"GPT names handle encoding separately; do not truncate Unicode by bytes. Chinese display capability"
" does not imply complete Unicode word segmentation, bidirectional layout, or grapheme-break "
"support."

msgid "配置与翻译"
msgstr "Configuration and translation"

msgid ""
"区域配置位于 ``/etc/reliefos/locale.conf``。应用通过 gettext 加载各自的翻译域， 域名与应用源码目录名一致。``configs/nls/DOMAINS`` "
"登记翻译域， ``configs/nls/LINGUAS`` 登记随系统构建的语言。"
msgstr ""
"Locale configuration is in ``/etc/reliefos/locale.conf``. Applications load their own gettext "
"domains, named after their source directories. ``configs/nls/DOMAINS`` registers translation "
"domains; ``configs/nls/LINGUAS`` registers languages built with the system."

msgid ""
"随系统提供 ``zh_CN`` 和 ``ja_JP`` 翻译。用户可在安装器选择日本語， 或在 ReliefSettings 中保存 ``ja_JP.UTF-8`` 并重新登录。 "
"日语翻译包括界面、公共对话框和各应用的错误提示。 第三方应用使用各自的上游翻译资源。"
msgstr ""
"The system includes ``zh_CN`` and ``ja_JP`` translations. Users can select Japanese in the "
"installer, or save ``ja_JP.UTF-8`` in ReliefSettings and log in again. Japanese translations cover"
" the UI, common dialogs, and application error messages. Third-party applications use their "
"upstream translation resources."

msgid ""
"例如，Fileman 的模板位于 ``configs/nls/po/fileman/fileman.pot``，中文译文位于 "
"``configs/nls/po/fileman/zh_CN.po``。``make nls`` 将其编译为 "
"``O/generated/nls/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/fileman.mo``，镜像安装到 "
"``/usr/share/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/fileman.mo``。Taskmgr 使用独立的 ``taskmgr`` 翻译域和对应目录。FLTK "
"公共按钮与文件选择器文案收录在各自应用的目录中。"
msgstr ""
"For example, Fileman's template is ``configs/nls/po/fileman/fileman.pot`` and its Chinese "
"translation is ``configs/nls/po/fileman/zh_CN.po``. ``make nls`` compiles it to "
"``O/generated/nls/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/fileman.mo``, installed in the image at "
"``/usr/share/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/fileman.mo``. Taskmgr has its own ``taskmgr`` domain and "
"corresponding directories. Common FLTK button and file-chooser text is included in each "
"application's catalog."

msgid ""
"修改 Fileman 文案后执行 ``make nls-update-fileman``，可更新该应用的模板和译文。 ``make nls-update`` "
"更新已登记的全部应用。提取范围包含应用的子目录、 公共 FLTK 头文件、Kbuild 中复用的实现及该应用的 ``configs/nls/messages/<应用名>.c`` 动态文案标记。 "
"新增应用时登记翻译域，并为 ``LINGUAS`` 中的每种语言创建对应的 PO 文件。 常规构建只生成所选输出树中的资源，翻译源文件由显式维护目标更新。 "
"系统更新时，应用二进制与对应翻译资源一起更新。"
msgstr ""
"After changing Fileman text, run ``make nls-update-fileman`` to update its template and "
"translations. ``make nls-update`` updates all registered applications. Extraction covers "
"application subdirectories, shared FLTK headers, implementations reused in Kbuild, and dynamic-"
"text markers in the application's ``configs/nls/messages/<应用名>.c``. Register a domain for each new"
" application and create a PO for every language in ``LINGUAS``. Normal builds generate resources "
"only in the selected output tree; explicit maintenance targets update translation sources. System "
"updates update application binaries and their translation resources together."

msgid ""
"日语目录位于各应用的 ``ja_JP.po``，生成和安装目录中的语言名为 ``ja_JP``。区域数据位于 ``configs/locale/ja_JP.po``，由 ``make musl-"
"locales`` 生成 ``ja_JP.UTF-8`` 并安装到 ``/usr/share/musl/locales/``，供 musl 的日期、星期和上午／下午格式使用。 "
"``MUSL_LOCPATH`` 指向该目录，应用仍使用标准的 ``setlocale`` 与 gettext。 显示语言不会自动改变键盘布局，布局由 ReliefSettings "
"的键盘页单独设置。"
msgstr ""
"Each application's Japanese catalog is ``ja_JP.po``; generated and installed directories use "
"``ja_JP``. Locale data is in ``configs/locale/ja_JP.po``. ``make musl-locales`` generates "
"``ja_JP.UTF-8`` and installs it in ``/usr/share/musl/locales/`` for musl date, weekday, and AM/PM "
"formatting. ``MUSL_LOCPATH`` points there; applications still use standard ``setlocale`` and "
"gettext. Display language does not automatically change the keyboard layout, which is configured "
"separately on ReliefSettings' keyboard page."

msgid ""
"自研控制台工具也使用各自的翻译域，包括 driverinfo、soundctl、wavplay、 rprfetch、登录与 Shell 包装程序、rcctl、Snake、Matrix "
"和登录系统信息。 IceWM 的窗口标题、任务栏和应用菜单通过原生 Xft 字体设置使用 CJK 字体。 应用桌面入口通过标准 ``Name[ja]``、``GenericName[ja]`` 与"
" ``Comment[ja]`` 字段提供日语名称和说明。"
msgstr ""
"In-house console tools also use their own domains, including driverinfo, soundctl, wavplay, "
"rprfetch, login and shell wrappers, rcctl, Snake, Matrix, and login system information. IceWM "
"window titles, taskbar, and application menus use CJK fonts through native Xft settings. Desktop "
"entries provide Japanese names and descriptions through standard ``Name[ja]``, "
"``GenericName[ja]``, and ``Comment[ja]`` fields."

msgid "原生文件格式的容量、恢复与字符边界见各应用手册。"
msgstr ""
"See each application's manual for native-format capacity, recovery, and character boundaries."
